    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm talking to you. i'm just... i'm so incredibly tired. and not like i need a nap kind of tired. it's like my whole soul is just done. every day feels like i'm dragging this heavy weight through mud and i just can't do it anymore. i'm just so tired of being me.",
