      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of resignation, where the fight itself feels more draining than the exhaustion. If the idea of \"fixing\" it feels dismissive, perhaps you need a space where you can just *be* with the feeling instead of trying to change it. Please know that while I am an AI, there are compassionate listeners available who can hear your truth without judgment. If you feel you are in immediate danger, please call emergency services right away.",
      "source": "target",
