    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to talk about \"being\" with it when \"being\" is what's causing all the pain. everything feels so pointless. like, i look at the future and i don't see anything but more of this. more weight, more mud, more fighting. sometimes i just wonder if there's actually any point in holding on when everything is just this empty. it feels like i'm just waiting for permission to finally rest.",
